y stays down however and  grigri was eventually resurrected by the  hand in 1994's daredevil annual number  10. with daredevil and chongqi's help  elektra defeats the assassin by stabbing  him in the head killing him once more  one of the most visually striking  villains in the trailer for shang chi  and the legend of the ten rings death  dealer appeared in only a handful of  comic book issues in 1982 while zhang  bao yu was director of mi6 a man named  lee ching lin infiltrated the agency's  ranks to serve as a double agent for  zheng zhu fearing chingling's brutality  value hired sir dennis naland smith and  her brother xiangchi to take out the  dangerous assassin shanxi easily bested  the double agent and forced ching lin to  flee back to zhang zhu who outfitted him  with new weapons and named him the death  dealer after meeting in battle on a  number of occasions death dealer and  chongqi fought one last time at jiang  zhu's castle still just as outmatched as  before death dealer was killed by  chongqi and master of kung fu number 118  when the hero hit the villain with a lit  brazier causing his costume to catch  fire  the main villain of the shanxi master of  kung fu mini-series moving shadow was  yet another son of zhongzu who sought to  defeat chongqi and replace him at their  father's side introduced in the series  first issue in 2002 moving shadow would  prove to be a challenging foe for his  heroic brother like chongqi moving  shadow was trained in the ways of  martial arts from birth but unlike the  master of kung fu he completely embraced  his father's evil ways and vowed to  serve him with absolute loyalty  ultimately shanxi once again proved  himself to be the better fighter and  defeated his half-brother in combat  utterly beaten and left in disgrace  moving shadow returned to zhengzhu but  the cold-blooded villain killed his son  for his failure  secret avengers number one introduced a  new threat to the marvel universe the  shadow council an organization formed by  confederate soldiers from the american  civil war who discovered a rift in time  and space after steve rogers returned  from his apparent death in 2010's  captain america reborn he decided to  form a new covert ops team of avengers  to investigate and defeat this new evil  when the shadow council tries to  resurrect zhang zhu steve rogers  approaches chongqi and asks for his help  rogers team of secret avengers includes  sharon carter the beast ant-man the  black widow valkyrie moon knight and war  machine and together they fight the  shadow council and a half dead zhang zhu  they eventually managed to disrupt the  ritual that would have fully resurrected  sean chi's villainous father sending him  right back to hell  though white dragon originally debuted  in 1978's amazing spider-man number 184  he wouldn't battle chongqi until 2014's  deadly hands of kung fu number two and  three when an old enemy named chao sima  approached the master of kung fu and  asked for his help in avenging the death  of his true love though he initially  distrusted the former villain chongqi  agreed to help him and the duel  infiltrated the white dragon's  headquarters where they discovered a  secret ritual led by none other than a  resurrected midnight sun  what a twist  as midnight's sun's willing servant the  white dragon held off chongqing and  chaosima until he killed skull crusher  in order to complete the ritual chaosima  had gotten the upper hand however and  made sure that the ceremony didn't grant  midnight's sun power but instead  resurrected his beloved lako who cast  sun into the underworld  introduced in 2020 xiangchi number one  one of the master of kung fu's most  recent villains is yet another secret  sibling zhong shiwa is shan chi's  younger sister and the two were raised  together until zoo separated them for  trespassing in a forbidden room zoo  branded the girl's forehead and lied to  her brother implying that she had been  executed in order to teach him a lesson  in reality xi wang was sent to russia to  join the five weapons society's house of  the deadly hammer where she finished her  training and adopted the title of  sisterhammer when zheng zhu died once  again the five weapons society was left  without a leader and sisterhammer was  determined to take her father's place  and lead the organization as she saw fit  naming herself the new supreme commander  chihuahua tried to have chongqi killed  but only succeeded in revealing to  shanghi that she is still alive the  master of kung fu attempted to convince  his long-lost sister to forsake their  father and leave his evil ways behind  but when she refused chongqi defeated  her in combat and took control of the  five weapons society himself vowing to  turn it into a force for good  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  marvel comics are coming soon subscribe  to our youtube channel and hit the bell  so you don't miss a single one

